Ayatsuri2D for Godot 3 is Apache-2.0, like the C interface it is built
on; the full text is in LICENSE-APACHE beside this file in a packed
release. The runtime inside the library (ayatsuri-core, ayatsuri-format,
ayatsuri-import) is MIT (LICENSE-MIT), and the Rust crates linked into the
library, among them the MIT gdnative binding and the Godot headers it
carries, keep their own licences, reproduced in THIRD-PARTY.md. A
closed-source game may ship this addon; keep these files with it.

Ayatsuri2D is made separately from Live2D Inc. Live2D and Cubism are Live2D
Inc. trademarks; they are named only to say which files this addon reads.
